\f1\fs22 While Johnny was contemplating his impending hero-hood, Tony rearranged a pyramid of empty bottles on a rickety table. He ground his teeth, and hurled ninja stars with his eyes at The Johnny, who was looking crazier all the time. But crazy is a relative term, which became apparent when three stick-insect men with long white beards approached the booth, wearing the kind of hooded onesies wizards might wear to bed.\
